                }
                // Touch file? Original: when editing new sheet, file may not exist initially, editor is launched with path that doesn't exist. Our earlier test with editor cat showed it tried to cat file that didn't exist and failed (exit 1). So cheat does NOT create file before editor; it lets editor create it. But we need to ensure parent dir exists before editor.
                target_path = dest;
            }
            None => {
